msgid ""
"A modular educational architecture spanning Pedagogy, Andragogy, Heutagogy, "
"Cybergogy, and Vocational Training—backed by cryptographic QR credentials "
"and peer mentorship."
msgstr ""
"Mfumo wa elimu unaojumuisha Pedagogy, Andragogy, Heutagogy, Cybergogy, na "
"Mafunzo ya Ufundi—ukiwa na vyeti vya QR vya siri na ushauri wa wataalamu."

msgid "Explore Vocational Catalog"
msgstr "Gundua Kozi za Ufundi"

msgid "Enter The Village Hub"
msgstr "Ingia Kituo cha Kijiji"

msgid "Our 5 Core Learning Pillars"
msgstr "Nguzo Zetu 5 za Kujifunza"

msgid ""
"Structured for rigorous, scalable education across languages and regions."
msgstr ""
"Imeundwa kwa elimu bora na thabiti inayoweza kupanuka katika lugha na maeneo"
" mbalimbali."

msgid "Vocational & Trade"
msgstr "Ufundi & Biashara"

msgid ""
"Practical artisan training including solar, phone/laptop repair, CCTV, and "
"barbing/beauty with 10-step field guides."
msgstr ""
"Mafunzo ya vitendo ya ufundi ikiwa ni pamoja na umeme wa jua, ukarabati wa "
"simu/kompyuta, CCTV, na unyozi/urembo kwa miongozo ya hatua 10."

msgid "Cybergogy & Tech"
msgstr "Teknolojia ya Kidijitali"

msgid ""
"Digital literacy, software development, AI prompting, and cloud "
"infrastructure training aligned with global certifications."
msgstr ""
"Ujuzi wa kidijitali, utengenezaji wa programu, AI, na miundombinu ya wingu "
"yenye vyeti vya kimataifa."

msgid "Andragogy & Business"
msgstr "Elimu ya Watu Wazima & Biashara"

msgid ""
"Adult education, lean startup methodologies, cooperative management, and "
"income-generation frameworks."
msgstr ""
"Elimu ya watu wazima, mbinu za kuanzisha biashara, usimamizi wa vyama vya "
"ushirika, na mifumo ya mapato."

msgid "Pedagogy"
msgstr "Elimu ya Msingi na Sekondari"

msgid ""
"Foundational primary and secondary school curricula designed with guardian "
"guidance notes and interactive learning."
msgstr ""
"Mitaala ya msingi na sekondari iliyoundwa kwa mwongozo wa walezi na "
"ujifunzaji shirikishi."

msgid "Heutagogy"
msgstr "Kujifunza kwa Kujitegemea"

msgid ""
"Self-determined mastery, independent strategic research, leadership "
"capstones, and portfolio development."
msgstr ""
"Ustadi wa kujitegemea, utafiti wa kimkakati, miradi ya uongozi, na ukuzaji "
"wa wasifu."

msgid "Featured Practical Courses"
msgstr "Kozi za Vitendo Zilizochaguliwa"

msgid ""
"Hands-on tracks built for immediate real-world execution and self-"
"employment."
msgstr ""
"Mafunzo ya vitendo yaliyojengwa kwa ajili ya utekelezaji wa haraka na "
"kujiajiri."

