msgid ""
"Accessible free learning paired with cryptographic verification and "
"enterprise workforce sponsorship."
msgstr ""
"Elimu ya bure inayopatikana kwa urahisi pamoja na uthibitisho wa vyeti vya "
"QR na ufadhili wa makampuni."

msgid "MOST POPULAR FOR EMPLOYABILITY"
msgstr "MAARUFU ZAIDI KWA AJIRA"

msgid "Certification and partnership plans will appear here."
msgstr "Mipango ya vyeti na ushirikiano itaonekana hapa."

msgid ""
"Empowering artisans, students, and digital professionals worldwide with "
